    "detailed_description": "A simple clicker game where you race against the clock to destroy as many Wojaks as possible by manipulating the markets using an intuitive UI. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-Retro pixel art style nuclear console view of the world<br />\r\n-Popups of Wojak's buying and selling popular stocks such as TSLA, GME etc.<br />\r\n-Rage sequences when destroying Wojak<br />\r\n-Wojak reactions to your actions <br />\r\n-2 Button flow:<br />\r\n1. Choose stock<br />\r\n2. Bompeet or Dompeet<br />\r\n3. Watch the Wojaks rage",
    "about_the_game": "A simple clicker game where you race against the clock to destroy as many Wojaks as possible by manipulating the markets using an intuitive UI. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n-Retro pixel art style nuclear console view of the world<br />\r\n-Popups of Wojak's buying and selling popular stocks such as TSLA, GME etc.<br />\r\n-Rage sequences when destroying Wojak<br />\r\n-Wojak reactions to your actions <br />\r\n-2 Button flow:<br />\r\n1. Choose stock<br />\r\n2. Bompeet or Dompeet<br />\r\n3. Watch the Wojaks rage",
